														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3247044">
									

<p>Liked the log and the ending note's implications for the rest of the story made it sufficiently interesting for me to upvote. It's put together very well technically and I didn't mind the premature reaction by the regional authority to dubbing it contained and moving on - that's probably the most interesting bit of this. As a sample of body horror it's not too gratuitous and also pretty original in that it's rocks that mush and consume the fleshlings, which is a pretty cool concept that's realized well with the victim in the incident report.</p>
<p>+1 nice and solid.</p>

